  "harnessVersion": "0.1.6-alpha.2",
  "notes": [
    "$events 是宿主级交互来源，只能经 WS 载体打开，endpoint 字面量是 '$events'，args 是空对象。",
    "waterfall 帧的 agentId 是必填字段（类型 RemoteEventAgentId，非空）。Harness 的身份设计是 agent 注册表 id 等于会话 id，所以 agentId 就是会话标识。",
    "因此会话归属是核事实，不是推断：不得再用 callId 反查或'唯一活跃会话'兜底作为主判据。",
    "ready 帧带 host.home；agentd 不得把该字段下发移动端。"
  ],
  "open": {
    "type": "open",
    "streamId": "stream-fixture-0002",
    "endpoint": "$events",
    "payload": {
      "args": {}
    }
  },
  "frames": {
    "ready": {
      "type": "item",
      "streamId": "stream-fixture-0002",
      "value": {
        "type": "ready",
        "clientId": "client-fixture-0001",
        "host": {
          "home": "/fixture/home"
        }
      }
    },
    "waterfallApproval": {
      "type": "item",
      "streamId": "stream-fixture-0002",
